 is here, and the attendants take turns off work to check it out.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/s9IFD0RfMYxqNa5ZsYAC9zjZY5T.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"The bon festival is here, and the attendants take turns off work to check it out.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/s9IFD0RfMYxqNa5ZsYAC9zjZY5T.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13030","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"98506","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"35241","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"74098","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"332979","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"24778","synopsis":"It’s a castaway! It's a mermaid! Actually, it's a troubled human girl, one of several people who have wandered into the inn’s presence recently.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gguvbnTQ5osiTcoWDvHncO5lFe8.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"It’s a castaway! It's a mermaid! Actually, it's a troubled human girl, one of several people who have wandered into the inn’s presence recently.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gguvbnTQ5osiTcoWDvHncO5lFe8.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13030","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"98506","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"35241","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"74098","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"332979","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"24779","synopsis":"The goddess of water bubbles pays a visit to Konohanatei. The reason for her stay doesn't become clear until it's a little too late.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/f6tFC4os41W3REUi1ymv2xv810G.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 9","synopsis":"The goddess of water bubbles pays a visit to Konohanatei. The reason for her stay doesn't become clear until it's a little too late.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/f6tFC4os41W3REUi1ymv2xv810G.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13030","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"98506","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"35241","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"74098","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"332979","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"24785","synopsis":"Satsuki inadvertently drinks a medicine that causes her to shrink down to a tiny size. Having to spend the day riding on Yuzu's shoulder, Satsuki is amazed by how good Yuzu has gotten at her job. After Satsuki returns to normal size, she and Yuzu attend to Hiiragi and her fellow priestess Ayame when they come to stay at the Konohanatei. As Satsuki deals with her sister's erratic behavior, Yuzu becomes worried over when Satsuki will inevitably leave the Konohanatei to be a priestess. At the behest of one of the guests, Satsuki is asked to perform a kagura dance alongside Hiiragi, leading her to feel frustrated when comparing herself to her. After Hiiragi takes her leave the next day, it is revealed she feels that Satsuki was chosen over her to work at the Konohanatei.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lofisrOMlrtwKLNupmvmrDGRTcO.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 10","synopsis":"Satsuki inadvertently drinks a medicine that causes her to shrink down to a tiny size. Having to spend the day riding on Yuzu's shoulder, Satsuki is amazed by how good Yuzu has gotten at her job. After Satsuki returns to normal size, she and Yuzu attend to Hiiragi and her fellow priestess Ayame when they come to stay at the Konohanatei. As Satsuki deals with her sister's erratic behavior, Yuzu becomes worried over when Satsuki will inevitably leave the Konohanatei to be a priestess. At the behest of one of the guests, Satsuki is asked to perform a kagura dance alongside Hiiragi, leading her to feel frustrated when comparing herself to her. After Hiiragi takes her leave the next day, it is revealed she feels that Satsuki was chosen over her to work at the Konohanatei.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lofisrOMlrtwKLNupmvmrDGRTcO.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13030","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"98506","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"35241","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"74098","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"332979","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"24784","synopsis":"An old man, who is a former god of battle, spends time entertaining Sakura with toys made from acorns while lamenting there is no need for him in a time of peace. Meanwhile, Yuzu hears about how the Konohanatei was like years ago from a woman, who turns out to be the fox landlady, Okami, in her human form. Later, Okiku comes across a discarded doll named Lily and brings her back to the Konohanatei, but finds the others are too busy to help fix her. Lily, who recognises that Okiku has remained pretty because she hadn't been played with, eventually disappears from the Konohanatei, after which she is found by her original owner.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gJhKH9puQX0nXRNlvDSE99nSi85.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 11","synopsis":"An old man, who is a former god of battle, spends time entertaining Sakura with toys made from acorns while lamenting there is no need for him in a time of peace. Meanwhile, Yuzu hears about how the Konohanatei was like years ago from a woman, who turns out to be the fox landlady, Okami, in her human form. Later, Okiku comes across a discarded doll named Lily and brings her back to the Konohanatei, but finds the others are too busy to help fix her. Lily, who recognises that Okiku has remained pretty because she hadn't been played with, eventually disappears from the Konohanatei, after which she is found by her original owner.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gJhKH9puQX0nXRNlvDSE99nSi85.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 12","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13030","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"98506","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"35241","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"74098","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"332979","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]}],"link":"24786","synopsis":"Yuzu finds a kenzoku scroll while cleaning Okami's room before going with everyone to the shrine to celebrate the new year. After briefly dropping it, Yuzu finds herself in another dimension where a girl name Tsubaki mistakes her for one of her co-workers and drags her to a shrine where kenzoku work to help grant the wishes of those who pray at the shrine. Learning that she might not be able to return to her one world, Yuzu decides to help out after one of the workers collapses, learning of all the malicious and kind-hearted wishes that people make. Hearing Yuzu's desire to return home to her friends, Tsubaki manages to open the scroll yuzu brought with her, giving her the ability to send Yuzu home safely. Afterwards, it is revealed that Tsubaki was actually Okami herself from many years ago, with Yuzu's actions leading to the creation of the Konohanatei.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eP2yO0qYwouLYAeIaV1dhYJ5brm.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 12","synopsis":"Yuzu finds a kenzoku scroll while cleaning Okami's room before going with everyone to the shrine to celebrate the new year. After briefly dropping it, Yuzu finds herself in another dimension where a girl name Tsubaki mistakes her for one of her co-workers and drags her to a shrine where kenzoku work to help grant the wishes of those who pray at the shrine. Learning that she might not be able to return to her one world, Yuzu decides to help out after one of the workers collapses, learning of all the malicious and kind-hearted wishes that people make. Hearing Yuzu's desire to return home to her friends, Tsubaki manages to open the scroll yuzu brought with her, giving her the ability to send Yuzu home safely. Afterwards, it is revealed that Tsubaki was actually Okami herself from many years ago, with Yuzu's actions leading to the creation of the Konohanatei.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eP2yO0qYwouLYAeIaV1dhYJ5brm.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}}],"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-10-30T07:57:40Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:98506","mal:35241"],"imdbSource":"plexanibridge-v2","targets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13030","scope":"R","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"anilist","id":"98506","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"mal","id":"35241","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"74098","scope":"s1","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"332979","scope":"s1","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}}]},"artworkInventory":{"logo":[{"source":"tmdb","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3owY7kScGzwA8gIds1kkL9WuXBu.p